      "body": "Cursor Usage 是一款非官方工具，用来查看 Cursor 各 AI 模型的用量统计。它补齐了官方面板的痛点：支持按月查看当前及历史计费周期，也支持按天查看任意日期范围的明细。数据以与官方一致的表格呈现。\nhttps://github.com/Bclound/cursor-usage\n\n<img width=\"440\" height=\"388\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/688ca9b9-f067-4a87-9cce-7eb4a07c637c\" />\n\n<img width=\"442\" height=\"332\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92d4c4e8-d590-428e-94d0-9fe4e6cd6265\" />",
